==In animation==
As an entity, Team Flare debuted in ''[[XY094|From A to Z!]]'', including its five scientists, [[Celosia]], [[Mable]], [[Aliana]], [[Bryony]], and [[Xerosic]]. However, [[Lysandre]] first appeared in ''[[XYS01|Mega Evolution Special I]]'' as a mysterious benefactor assisting [[Alain]] on his quest in exchange for information on [[Mega Evolution]]. Lysandre and Team Flare eventually went on to become the main antagonists of the ''XY & Z'' arc of ''[[Pokémon the Series: XY]]''.

==In the manga==
===Pokémon Adventures===
The Team Flare Scientist appeared early on in the {{MangaArc|X & Y}}, observing [[Xerxer|Xerneas]] and {{p|Yveltal}}'s battle in [[Vaniville Town]] and attempting to steal {{adv|X}}'s [[Mega Ring]]. [[Lysandre]] debuted soon after, observing a video of the aforementioned battle at [[Professor Sycamore]]'s laboratory. Team Flare as a whole served as the major antagonists of the chapter.
